                    "frequency": "High",
                    "semantic_group_id": "animal",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The zoo has a large exhibit featuring every type of <w>reptile</w> from snakes to turtles."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Many people keep a small <w>reptile</w> like a lizard as a pet in their home."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "sense_id": "525458f9-a80e-3127-b987-df8c9996a26d",
                    "sense_definition": "A person who is considered mean, dishonest, or repulsive.",
                    "learner_level": "C1",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "insult",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "He is such a <w>reptile</w> for betraying his best friend just to get a promotion."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Do not trust that <w>reptile</w> because he will say anything to get what he wants."
                        }
                    ],
